    "text": "By Benjamin Cortez ,\n1 days ago A Falmouth man has been arrested for an alleged burglary that occurred at a Lakeville hardware store, with an estimated $3,000 worth of power tools reported as stolen. The incident took place last Sunday night, and the Lakeville Police Department was swift to respond after a burglary alarm brought them to the scene. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak 2",
